{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-common-biology-23","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":23,"points":null,"unitId":"immune","unitLabel":"면역학","topic":"항체·항원·림프구","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["immune"],"stem":"생쥐의항체합성기작을알아보기위한실험에서다음과같은\n결과를얻었다. 생쥐에적당량의방사선을조사하면체내에존재\n하는모든림프구를제거할수있다.\n(\n: 방사선을조사한생쥐,\n: 정상생쥐)\n위결과를보고항체합성기작에대해내릴수있는해석이나\n결론으로타당한것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 항원A에대한최적의항체합성에는T 림프구가필요\n하다.\nㄴ. 항원유입시항체합성을저해하는T 림프구가형성될\n수있다.\nㄷ. 항원의유입량에따라B 림프구의항원인지정도는\n다르다.\nㄹ. 유입되는항원의양에따라생성되는항체합성량은\n다를수있다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":474,"height":27,"region":0,"bbox":[18.511,59.604,189.6,10.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-23/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":725,"height":376,"region":0,"bbox":[14.511,81.604,290.0,150.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-23/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":725,"height":376,"region":0,"bbox":[14.511,243.604,290.0,150.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-23/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":744,"height":408,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,451.204,297.6,163.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-23/04.webp"}],